// (samples/enjektor_09DB01.pcad, generated by samples/tools/gen_enjektor.py from docs/enjektor/spec.json)
// and for the small engine extensions it needs (Plane kind=axisAngle, Pattern count=1, Combine largestOnly,
// feature prop mfg=0). The tests print the tables quoted in docs/enjektor/MODEL.md.
